{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":1208784,"duration_api_ms":1193380,"num_turns":37,"result":"Now let me produce the execution payload JSON.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"change_summary\": \"Added calibration-report workflow module to tank_harness crate. Created `calibration.rs` with structured report types (CalibrationReport, ScenarioRow, CheckpointRow, FieldCheck, CheckStatus), a CalibrationRun wrapper that delegates to the shared HarnessRun harness, per-field marginal classification (within 10% of envelope boundary), cross-run comparison support, and machine-readable JSON output. Added `calibration_report.rs` integration test file with all 7 required tests covering report structure, JSON round-trip, artifact paths, cross-run comparison, marginal classification, shared harness delegation, and full workflow across all 3 shipped scenarios completing in <1s.\",\n  \"outstanding_risks\": [\n    \"The full_calibration_workflow integration test uses abbreviated 4-week runs with loose envelopes; real calibration campaigns may want tighter envelopes matching the validation suite's literature-backed bounds.\",\n    \"Timestamp generation uses a manual Hinnant civil-calendar algorithm rather than a time library; leap-second edge cases are not handled but are negligible for report timestamps.\",\n    \"The marginal width for one-sided bounds (e.g., do_min) uses 10% of the absolute value of the finite bound, which may not be the ideal threshold for all physical quantities.\"\n  ],\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Created `crates/tank_harness/src/calibration.rs` with CheckStatus enum (Pass/Marginal/Fail with severity ordering), FieldCheck (observed + bounds as Option<f64> for JSON safety), CheckpointRow, ScenarioRow, ReportSummary, CalibrationReport (with from_rows and compare methods), ComparisonReport/StatusChange types, CalibrationRun wrapper (delegates to HarnessRun for execution/artifacts, adds classified envelope checking), check_classified public function, classify_f64/classify_u32/marginal_width helpers, and ISO-8601 timestamp generation. 16 unit tests covering classification logic, marginal widths, status ordering, timestamp formatting, and serde round-trips.\",\n      \"order\": 1,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Updated `crates/tank_harness/src/lib.rs` to add `pub mod calibration;` exposing the calibration module.\",\n      \"order\": 2,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Created `crates/tank_harness/tests/calibration_report.rs` with all 7 required tests: test_calibration_report_structure (verifies scenario_id, seed, parameter_variant, checkpoint_hours, observed_values, envelope_bounds, status), test_report_machine_readable (JSON round-trip), test_report_includes_artifact_paths (failed/marginal rows point to artifact dirs), test_report_comparison_across_runs (aligns scenarios by id, highlights status changes), test_marginal_classification (temperature at 25.1 in [25,30] = marginal, 27.5 = pass, 24.5 = fail), test_report_uses_shared_harness (verifies delegation to HarnessRun checkpoints), test_full_calibration_workflow (runs all 3 shipped scenarios in <60s, produces valid JSON report).\",\n      \"order\": 3,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Fixed JSON serialization issue where f64::INFINITY from do_min() envelopes serialized as null. Changed FieldCheck bounds to Option<f64> (None = unbounded) and observed to Option<f64> (None = non-finite). All 76 tests pass, clippy and fmt clean.\",\n      \"order\": 4,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"validation_evidence\": [\n    \"All 22 tank_harness unit tests pass (16 new calibration + 6 existing)\",\n    \"All 7 calibration_report integration tests pass: test_calibration_report_structure, test_report_machine_readable, test_report_includes_artifact_paths, test_report_comparison_across_runs, test_marginal_classification, test_report_uses_shared_harness, test_full_calibration_workflow\",\n    \"test_full_calibration_workflow runs all 3 shipped scenarios (nano_cycle, medium_planted, warm_room) with 2 checkpoints each in 0.54s (well under 60s CI limit)\",\n    \"All 47 existing e2e tests continue to pass unchanged (baseline, validation suite, conservation, carbonate, geometry, shrimp, habitat probes)\",\n    \"cargo clippy -p tank_harness -- -D warnings passes with zero warnings\",\n    \"cargo fmt -p tank_harness --check passes with no formatting differences\",\n    \"CalibrationReport JSON round-trips correctly (serialize -> deserialize -> verify equality)\",\n    \"ComparisonReport correctly identifies 2 status changes between two fabricated reports (nano_cycle Pass->Marginal, medium_planted Fail->Pass) while excluding unchanged warm_room\"\n  ]\n}\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"e4d84bcd-dcd1-400b-8bda-cbb800f9e8bd","total_cost_usd":4.670149249999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":270,"cache_creation_input_tokens":139238,"cache_read_input_tokens":3522188,"output_tokens":66406,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":113691,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":25547},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":270,"outputTokens":66406,"cacheReadInputTokens":3522188,"cacheCreationInputTokens":139238,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":4.292831499999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000},"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":394,"outputTokens":14711,"cacheReadInputTokens":1353900,"cacheCreationInputTokens":134383,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.3773177499999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"ff5fc359-0d9a-4614-8061-1cf62712afcd"}
